    {
      "id": "535b98112e05-q2",
      "number": 2,
      "question": "Which of the given Venn diagrams best represents a relationship among \"Carnivorous, Lion and Deer\" ?",
      "questionHtml": "Which of the given Venn diagrams best represents a relationship among <strong>&quot;Carnivorous, Lion and Deer&quot;</strong>?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "",
          "html": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/01/F2_Ven%20Diagram_Shraddha_Jan_2021_D1%20%2820%29.png\" style=\"width: 81px; height: 81px;\" />"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "",
          "html": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/01/F2_Ven%20Diagram_Shraddha_Jan_2021_D1%20%2810%29.png\" style=\"width: 81px; height: 81px;\" />"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "",
          "html": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/01/F2_Ven%20Diagram_Shraddha_Jan_2021_D1%20%283%29.png\" style=\"width: 82px; height: 82px;\" />"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "",
          "html": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/01/F2_Ven%20Diagram_Shraddha_Jan_2021_D1%20%2814%29.png\" style=\"width: 81px; height: 81px;\" />"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Given: </strong>LION, CARNIVOROUS, DEER.</p>\n\n<p>Lion is a carnivorous animal and deer is a herbivorous animal and both are in a different category.</p>\n\n<p>The Venn diagram is as follow-</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/01/F2_PoojaS_Madhuri_29.01.2022_D32.png\" style=\"width: 188px; height: 118px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>Hence, <strong>Option (4)</strong> is the answer.</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;\"><img height=\"26px\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/important-point-image.png\" width=\"26px\" /><strong><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;\"><u>Important Points</u></span></strong></span><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><u>Herbivores</u>:</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(32, 33, 36); letter-spacing: 0.25px;\">Herbivores are&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.25px;\">animals whose primary food source is plant-based</span><span style=\"color: rgb(32, 33, 36); letter-spacing: 0.25px;\">.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"text-align: center;\"><u>Carnivorous</u>:</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(32, 33, 36); letter-spacing: 0.25px;\">carnivorous is&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.25px;\">an animal that eats the meat of other animals</span><span style=\"color: rgb(32, 33, 36); letter-spacing: 0.25px;\">&nbsp;or a plant that traps and digests insects or other small animals. A person who eats meat is an example of someone who would be described as carnivorous.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"text-align: center;\"><u>Omnivores</u>:</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"text-align: center;\">Omnivores is&nbsp;</span>an animal that eats both plants and meat.</p>\n",
      "images": [
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/01/F2_Ven%20Diagram_Shraddha_Jan_2021_D1%20%2820%29.png",
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/01/F2_Ven%20Diagram_Shraddha_Jan_2021_D1%20%2810%29.png",
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/01/F2_Ven%20Diagram_Shraddha_Jan_2021_D1%20%283%29.png",
